.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		ORCA, UHF/cc-pVTZ with a broken-symmetry guess, scan of the H-H distance from 4.0 to 0.3 Å. This calculation shows the unrestricted solution reaching the energy of two hydrogen atoms, with <S²> rising from 0 towards 1 beyond the Coulson-Fischer point between 1.2 and 1.3 Å.
